{"about_the_game":"Just Ski is a challenging, minimalist, physics driven game that will frustrate and punish you in the beginning but reward you with the feeling of mastery in the end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/469e58a1df00b68e1f6e69c00bf5f763.poster.avif?t=1638291596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/469e58a1df00b68e1f6e69c00bf5f763.webm?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/469e58a1df00b68e1f6e69c00bf5f763.mp4?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Controls</h2>The controls for Just Ski are borrowed from an old, abandoned game called Ski Stunt Simulator. <br><br><br>Your only control over the skier is to move your mouse down to make him crouch or up to make him extend. It's a very simple to understand mechanic but requires a healthy amount of practice to master. <br><br>The key to success with Just Ski is learning to control your rotation while in the air.  It's all about gaining a feel for the conservation of angular momentum:  crouch to spin faster, extend to spin slower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/e8f0ad558d163f5b4a577af57d63977c.poster.avif?t=1638291596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/e8f0ad558d163f5b4a577af57d63977c.webm?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/e8f0ad558d163f5b4a577af57d63977c.mp4?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Goal</h2>Just ski to the cabin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learning Curve</h2><br>Like learning to ride a bike, Just Ski is going to feel clunky and impossible in the beginning, but once mastered will feel smooth and rewarding with just the right amount of challenge to keep things interesting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/4cb725e846cb7ebbe71f65657e1df22e.poster.avif?t=1638291596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/4cb725e846cb7ebbe71f65657e1df22e.webm?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/4cb725e846cb7ebbe71f65657e1df22e.mp4?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-Have fun and thanks for playing!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4aee0de45b51fa44980e5d076de3dccb65a74955.jpg","localized_name":"First Jump","name":"First Jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/4aee0de45b51fa44980e5d076de3dccb65a74955.jpg"},{"icon":"1716d2ea85f11cfe4d1ae1fa2ef1d710ec6c51cc.jpg","localized_name":"Red Sky","name":"Red Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/1716d2ea85f11cfe4d1ae1fa2ef1d710ec6c51cc.jpg"},{"icon":"9bff29e627fdac9578e9b559bbf571c01462d5b1.jpg","localized_name":"Orange Sky","name":"Orange Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/9bff29e627fdac9578e9b559bbf571c01462d5b1.jpg"},{"icon":"5d330d0c0346221d2476f0b6f7293519b0188ca1.jpg","localized_name":"Yellow sky","name":"Yellow sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/5d330d0c0346221d2476f0b6f7293519b0188ca1.jpg"},{"icon":"6bc16a7cdd4f0a8a5eaea2e5595ce66e70ed0975.jpg","localized_name":"Green Sky","name":"Green Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/6bc16a7cdd4f0a8a5eaea2e5595ce66e70ed0975.jpg"},{"icon":"7f260b4808bf3890177849580acf18ab4d97b479.jpg","localized_name":"Blue Sky","name":"Blue Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/7f260b4808bf3890177849580acf18ab4d97b479.jpg"},{"icon":"6f6d97cfb17de18ce696de31350119fd37a30d8d.jpg","localized_name":"Purple Sky","name":"Purple Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/6f6d97cfb17de18ce696de31350119fd37a30d8d.jpg"},{"icon":"5f0d37f203d11953dd38b58ff16cfcfc9750187e.jpg","localized_name":"Black Sky","name":"Black Sky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/5f0d37f203d11953dd38b58ff16cfcfc9750187e.jpg"},{"icon":"c5b7b6bcdc7b005af264e7e31468303ab5820671.jpg","localized_name":"Cabin","name":"Cabin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/c5b7b6bcdc7b005af264e7e31468303ab5820671.jpg"},{"icon":"1e150e2e2cc7dbb924a821f7e15b9eaab7efc87a.jpg","localized_name":"Cabin front flips only","name":"Cabin front flips only","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/740230/1e150e2e2cc7dbb924a821f7e15b9eaab7efc87a.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/740230?t=1638291596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1638291596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1638291596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1638291596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Check Out My Latest Game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Just Ski is a challenging, minimalist, physics driven game that will frustrate and punish you in the beginning but reward you with the feeling of mastery in the end.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/469e58a1df00b68e1f6e69c00bf5f763.poster.avif?t=1638291596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/469e58a1df00b68e1f6e69c00bf5f763.webm?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/469e58a1df00b68e1f6e69c00bf5f763.mp4?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Controls</h2>The controls for Just Ski are borrowed from an old, abandoned game called Ski Stunt Simulator. <br><br><br>Your only control over the skier is to move your mouse down to make him crouch or up to make him extend. It's a very simple to understand mechanic but requires a healthy amount of practice to master. <br><br>The key to success with Just Ski is learning to control your rotation while in the air.  It's all about gaining a feel for the conservation of angular momentum:  crouch to spin faster, extend to spin slower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/e8f0ad558d163f5b4a577af57d63977c.poster.avif?t=1638291596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/e8f0ad558d163f5b4a577af57d63977c.webm?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/e8f0ad558d163f5b4a577af57d63977c.mp4?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Goal</h2>Just ski to the cabin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learning Curve</h2><br>Like learning to ride a bike, Just Ski is going to feel clunky and impossible in the beginning, but once mastered will feel smooth and rewarding with just the right amount of challenge to keep things interesting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/4cb725e846cb7ebbe71f65657e1df22e.poster.avif?t=1638291596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/4cb725e846cb7ebbe71f65657e1df22e.webm?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/extras/4cb725e846cb7ebbe71f65657e1df22e.mp4?t=1638291596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>-Have fun and thanks for playing!","developers":["Jeff Weber"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740230/header.jpg?t=1638291596","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/740230/325956/86f32cf026f0628cc353611336109f01726b270a/1751138344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1606041686","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/740230/325956/86f32